{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2023-01-26 17:00:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY DECLARES SUPPLEMENTAL DIVIDEND ON COMMON SHARES', 'text': 'RETURNING $0.90 PER SHARE SUPPLEMENTAL DIVIDEND, RESULTING IN $1.62 PER SHARE OF TOTAL DIVIDENDS BASED ON 2022 RESULTS DELIVERING TOTAL CASH RETURN TO SHAREHOLDERS OF $1.75 BILLION, OR 75 PERCENT OF ADJUSTED FUNDS AVAILABLE FOR DISTRIBUTION, BASED ON 2022 RESULTS SEATTLE , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A SUPPLEMENTAL DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.90\xa0PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE IN CASH ON\xa0FEBRUARY 27, 2023, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF SUCH COMMON STOCK AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0FEBRUARY 15, 2023. IN 2022, WEYERHAEUSER GENERATED ADJUSTED FUNDS AVAILABLE FOR DISTRIBUTION (ADJUSTED FAD) OF MORE THAN $2.3 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2023-01-26 16:45:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER, FULL YEAR RESULTS', 'text': 'GENERATED FULL YEAR NET EARNINGS OF $1.9 BILLION, OR $2.53 PER DILUTED SHARE ACHIEVED FULL YEAR ADJUSTED EBITDA OF $3.7 BILLION RETURNING $1.75 BILLION IN TOTAL CASH BACK TO SHAREHOLDERS BASED ON 2022 RESULTS, INCLUDING $550 MILLION OF SHARE REPURCHASE COMPLETED IN 2022 SEATTLE , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY REPORTED FOURTH QUARTER NET EARNINGS OF\xa0$11 MILLION, OR 2 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $1.8 BILLION. THIS COMPARES WITH NET EARNINGS OF $416 MILLION, OR 55 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $2.2 BILLION\xa0FOR THE SAME PERIOD LAST YEAR AND NET EARNINGS OF $310 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2022.'}